<title>USA: Giga Information Group IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Giga Information Group IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Giga Information Group Inc has been postponed &quot;due to market conditions,&quot; said the syndicate department of lead underwriter, Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>The underwriter added that the deal was not likely to resurface, and would have to refile in any case.</p>
<p>Giga was expected to price 4 million shares today in a range of $9 to $11 a share. The issue would have traded on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol &quot;GIGX.&quot;</p>
</text>
